[0.377, "o", "\u001b[31mAgentvow will not let this through: a claim about this change was contradicted, a rule in this\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "\u001b[31m  repository's policy is set to block it, or the check could not be trusted. It stays blocked\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.074, "o", "\u001b[31m  until the cause is fixed.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.076, "o", "\u001b[1mWhat Agentvow found\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.071, "o", "- A claim made about this change is false: tests that passed before the change fail after it. What\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.073, "o", "  to do: Fix the code, or correct the claim. This cannot be acknowledged away.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "  - Detail: The check found the 'tests_pass' claim contradicted. A contradiction cannot be\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.071, "o", "  acknowledged away: change the code or correct the claim. (rule: `contradicted`)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
