[0.367, "o", "\u001b[33mAgentvow could not fully confirm this change. A person named in the repository's policy must look\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "\u001b[33m  at it and acknowledge it before it can merge.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "\u001b[1mWhat Agentvow found\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.074, "o", "- A claim could not be confirmed or refuted. Typical causes: the number of passing tests did not\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "  match what was said, a dependency or a credential the tests need was missing in the replay, or\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.070, "o", "  the only failures were ones that also happen without the change. What to do: Open the `gate /\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "  replay` job log for the exact cause (the receipt deliberately keeps no free text), decide\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "  whether you are satisfied, and if so a listed acknowledger acknowledges it as described below.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "  - Detail: The 'tests_pass' claim could not be confirmed or refuted (UNKNOWN): the evidence was\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "  missing or the replay could not run. (rule: `unknown`)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "\u001b[1mTo acknowledge: a listed acknowledger records an acknowledgement for receipt `4a9acd2304ea`\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "\u001b[1m  (`agentvow policy evaluate --ack FILE`), or uses the control plane service, where they comment\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "\u001b[1m  `/agentvow acknowledge <id>` on the pull request. Listed acknowledgers: @alice. A contradiction\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.075, "o", "\u001b[1m  can never be acknowledged.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
